* [[Yamagata Masakage]] – legendary general of the Seto-Tosa Period
* [[Kenzan Mihashi]] – Prime Minister of Okaiken (1916–1922)
* [[Tatewaki Naoe]] – renowned architect of the post-war reconstruction

